OL,3,AEx-OpenAI worker accused of planting
OL,4,Abug had Saudi support, claims
OL,5,Aprosecutors
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 35-year-old engineer was deemed a
OL,8,Fflight risk and denied bail on Monday,
OL,9,Fpending a trial.
OL,11,FThe Saudi government did not respond to
OL,12,FBBC requests for comment.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
