OL,3,ABBC Three, BBC Scotland and Radio 4
OL,4,AExtra broadcast channels to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC is to close its BBC Three and
OL,7,FBBC Scotland television channels in the
OL,8,Fspring, as the corporation continues to
OL,9,Fmake #500m of savings over two years.
OL,11,FBoth services will become online-only,
OL,12,Fmeaning they will continue to produce
OL,13,Fand host some content on iPlayer,
OL,14,Fwithout the need to fill a terrestrial
OL,15,FTV schedule.
OL,17,FThe BBC has also announced the closure
OL,18,Fof Radio 4 Extra, which largely airs
OL,19,Fspeech programmes from the BBC's
OL,20,Farchive, including comedy, drama and
OL,21,Fdocumentaries.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11911
SC,0011
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1792520651
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABBC Three, BBC Scotland and Radio 4
OL,4,AExtra broadcast channels to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC director-general Matt Brittin said:
OL,7,F"We need to make every pound work
OL,8,Fharder for audiences as we respond to
OL,9,Fthe immediate cost pressures and
OL,10,Freinvent the BBC for a changing world.
OL,11,FWe all know that means tough choices."
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
